<title>GERMANY: KM Europa 1996 pre-tax profit up.</title>
<headline>KM Europa 1996 pre-tax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>OSNABRUECK, Germany 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     119.0   vs 100.1</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			  48.8    vs 45.1</p>
<p>    Dividend				     7.50    vs 7.0 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Non-ferrous metals group KM Europa Metal is part of the Italian SMI.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
